stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> NoUndo
    NoUndo --> UndoAvailable: Log set
    UndoAvailable --> NoUndo: Undo used - set removed, values restored
    UndoAvailable --> Committed: Save confirmed
    UndoAvailable --> Gone: Discard confirmed
    Committed --> [*]
    Gone --> [*]
    note right of UndoAvailable
      Stays available through: minimise, resume,
      pause, tab change, rest ending.
      Logging the next set moves Undo to that set;
      the earlier set is then committed.
    end note
